---
import AppDocLayout from '../../layouts/AppDocLayout.astro';
---

<AppDocLayout
  title="Pressure Easy - Privacy Policy"
  description="Privacy policy for Pressure Easy - Blood Pressure Tracker iOS app."
  ogUrl="https://idlefusion.com/pressure-easy/privacy"
>
  <main>
    <section class="section-padding">
      <div class="max-w-2xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
        <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-[var(--text-primary)] mb-2">Privacy Policy</h1>
        <p class="text-sm text-[var(--text-secondary)] mb-12">Pressure Easy - Blood Pressure Tracker &middot; Effective October 22, 2026</p>

        <div class="space-y-8 text-[var(--text-secondary)] leading-relaxed">
          <div>
            <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[var(--text-primary)] mb-3">The Short Version</h2>
            <p>Pressure Easy does not collect or transmit any personal data. Your blood pressure readings stay on your iPhone and Apple Watch, and in Apple Health only if you turn it on.</p>
          </div>

          <div>
            <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[var(--text-primary)] mb-3">Data Storage</h2>
            <p>Your blood pressure readings, pulse, notes and settings are stored on your iPhone, where the app and its widget can read them. No data is sent to any server, cloud service or third party. There are no user accounts and no sign-up.</p>
          </div>

          <div>
            <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[var(--text-primary)] mb-3">Apple Watch</h2>
            <p>If you use the Apple Watch app, readings you add on the watch are sent straight to Pressure Easy on your paired iPhone, and your iPhone sends your latest readings and averages back to the watch. This uses Apple's watch connection between your own devices; nothing passes through our servers.</p>
          </div>

          <div>
            <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[var(--text-primary)] mb-3">Apple Health</h2>
            <p class="mb-3">Pressure Easy works with Apple Health only if you turn it on and grant permission. With your permission it saves the blood pressure and pulse of your readings to Apple Health, and reads blood pressure and heart rate so you can add readings that other apps, like a connected monitor, saved there. Health data is governed by <a href="https://www.apple.com/legal/privacy/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-[var(--accent-primary)] hover:underline">Apple's privacy policy</a>. Pressure Easy never sends it anywhere else and never uses it for advertising.</p>
            <p>If you don't connect Apple Health, the app works the same: you can still add readings, see trends and create reports. You can change Pressure Easy's access at any time in the Health app.</p>
          </div>

          <div>
            <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[var(--text-primary)] mb-3">Analytics & Tracking</h2>
            <p>Pressure Easy contains no analytics frameworks, no ad SDKs, no tracking pixels, and no telemetry of any kind. We do not use any third-party services that collect data.</p>
          </div>

          <div>
            <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[var(--text-primary)] mb-3">Network Usage</h2>
            <p>Pressure Easy makes no network requests. The app works entirely offline. The only network activity associated with the app is through the App Store for updates.</p>
          </div>

          <div>
            <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[var(--text-primary)] mb-3">PDF Export</h2>
            <p>When you create a doctor report, the PDF is made on your iPhone. Pressure Easy does not upload it anywhere. You choose how and where to share it from the share sheet, and the app deletes its copy when the share sheet closes.</p>
          </div>

          <div>
            <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[var(--text-primary)] mb-3">Children's Privacy</h2>
            <p>Pressure Easy does not knowingly collect any information from anyone, including children under the age of 13.</p>
          </div>

          <div>
            <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[var(--text-primary)] mb-3">Changes to This Policy</h2>
            <p>If this policy changes, we will update this page with the new effective date. Since Pressure Easy collects no data, meaningful changes are unlikely.</p>
          </div>

          <div>
            <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[var(--text-primary)] mb-3">Contact</h2>
            <p>Questions about this policy? Email us at <a href="mailto:support@idlefusion.com" class="text-[var(--accent-primary)] hover:underline">support@idlefusion.com</a>.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</AppDocLayout>
